* This exec builds CREXX for CMS370
&ERROR &EXIT &RETCODE
CP SPOOL CONS START TO * PURGE
&SRCDISK = &1
&BINDISK = &2
&IF .&SRCDISK EQ . &SRCDISK = D
&IF .&BINDISK EQ . &BINDISK = E

* Build DEBUG versions
EXEC CMSBUILD D &SRCDISK &BINDISK
* Build non-DEBUG versions
EXEC CMSBUILD N &SRCDISK &BINDISK

EXEC CMSTEST &SRCDISK

&EXIT 0
